/y9xKKHNCFH0zYa8HDX9mJqnw92l.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2771317829457364,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":62904,\"title\":\"Just Add Magic\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/v7olj5StoSFVsgkBhOihDaR56eJ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.27488584474885847,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":96884,\"title\":\"Dragon Quest: The Adventure of Dai\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i28TVlLozR09hqkGsSlu5wa1X2J.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2720238095238095,\"_genreOverlap\":2}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/t6TcPx1Q9dXRc8i1tFFMezGKkIR.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2015-09-18\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Evie's Explosion of Taste\",\"overview\":\"Evie begs Mal to help her fix the cupcakes she baked for the Heroes and Heroines Festival at Auradon Prep. But instead, their sweet intentions end up in an explosion of taste! \",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z3eDpmBTmK42wPHiyiMqMHgSvIT.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-18\",\"runtime\":4},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Mal's Digi-Image Problem\",\"overview\":\"Mal gets a bit too carried away while painting a portrait of Audrey and Ben tells her she might have a Digi-image problem!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qVIrhal01evcnbHuwq9jTRr4zL5.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-25\",\"runtime\":4},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Audrey's New Do? New Don't!\",\"overview\":\"Audrey is frustrated about all of the attention that the edgy VK style is getting, so she convinces Jane to transform her hair into “something really out there.”\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/31pyYwoy1vDxh9oelDSZveE5j91.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-02\",\"runtime\":4},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Careful What You Wish For\",\"overview\":\"Everyone seems to be in need of Mal’s help. Pushed to the brink, Mal makes a wish that's more than she bargained for.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6lpdBGzyZr4Pw8R02GhhW3MESYz.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-09\",\"runtime\":3},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Voodoo? You Do\",\"overview\":\"Back home on the Isle of the Lost, Mal realizes that she better get her Auradon friends out of sight before something bad happens.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/unz1lDm2QmtdG6tCo7X9WnxixYT.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-16\",\"runtime\":4},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Lamp Sweet Lamp\",\"overview\":\"The roles are switched on the Isle of the Lost when it’s the AKs that don’t fit in, while the VKs bond over their rotten ways.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/422vf84NCmUGQrO21IP1RCV2YIb.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-23\",\"runtime\":4},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Genie Chic\",\"overview\":\"Being inside Jordan’s magic lamp means following her dress code – “genie chic” dress code that is. Freddie realizes she's in Auradon.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iGpZnj2Oj0pkLkkxlpVjCCSOiJ5.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-06\",\"runtime\":4},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Puffed Deliciousness\",\"overview\":\"Though Freddie is still trying to adjust to the new un-rotten ways of Auradon, she instantly grows fond of the puffed deliciousness in the dining hall.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bAKRlGvGGj1kvEWGTBLcwIjYnxr.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-13\",\"runtime\":4},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Good is the New Bad\",\"overview\":\"The competition is fierce at Auradon's annual singing competition. When each team tries to outshine the other, they realize that they harmonize better when they sing together.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zkcY3ylEBsM94VonGpqXyZDeiYI.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-20\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Spirit Day\",\"overview\":\"Mal and Evie show up for Spirit Day, and realize the cheer sounds a lot like a childhood spell they used to hear.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vhEMdZXtjorlxElbkO7anPHyckq.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-04\",\"runtime\":4},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"I'm Your Girl\",\"overview\":\"Evie proves to be quite the chemist fashionista when she helps Lonnie glow at her talent show performance.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mBndR3UfaHWE7s3pTCmBHgo3y5J.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-11\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Mash It Up\",\"overview\":\"The girls are back in Jordan’s magic lamp as they plan the theme for the upcoming dance at Auradon Prep.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2zSIcWzMgaA85AyaO94Xv4kF8Hj.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-13\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"All Hail the New Q.N.L.B.\",\"overview\":\"The VKs are becoming a source of chaos and suspicion when Jane’s mascot uniform is stolen and Audrey isn’t voted Queen of the Neon Lights Ball.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ypTBD8JMgySUp1knseFDnAs0Lv6.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-05\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Mad for Tea\",\"overview\":\"Despite solving multiple dress fiascos, Mal and Evie’s good intentions backfire when their help further arises suspicion from the AKs.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gehubXSwtjNfl6tKI9PfxTUM5kS.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-06\",\"runtime\":6},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Carpet Jacked\",\"overview\":\"Carlos, Jay and the magic carpet fail to show up to give the girls a ride to the party. Since the VKs can't be trusted, it's up to Jane to whip up a ride!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nvS6sYh4n2ahniP3mAaZJqET37B.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-07\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"The Night is Young\",\"overview\":\"At the Neon Lights Ball, the party is halted when the DJ cord is mysteriously found cut. Thankfully, Freddie is there to save the day - or was that her plan all along?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6cIx2V3Fru474VT6xSB4b8JnIxL.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-14\",\"runtime\":6},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Neon Lights Out\",\"overview\":\"More chaos ensues at the Neon Lights Ball when Jay and Carlos reveal that they’ve been carpet-jacked and Ben mysteriously disappears. Who could be behind all of the chaos?!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/znoIcpbwuvw8tPV4QsppYtUAq3y.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-15\",\"runtime\":6},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Hooked On Ben\",\"overview\":\"The culprit who’s been behind the chaos all along is revealed, but that won’t stop Auradon Prep from keeping the party alive!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uuDdsSLoLmlBgid71wcj845g1VI.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-15\",\"runtime\":6}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2015-09-18\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}